{"document_id": 115, "sha256": "620c94a5a95d6ab95adcb08f04f7284d03c953c8e62890fcb8dff978318d0b99", "agency": "fda", "doc_type": "approval_letter", "program_id": "stelara", "engine": "prep-1.4+docling2.137.0+tables-accurate+repair1+pictables1", "watermarks_removed": 0, "routes": [{"page": 1, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=1981"}, {"page": 2, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=2539"}, {"page": 3, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=1756"}, {"page": 4, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=528"}], "blocks": [{"type": "picture", "ref": "#/pictures/0", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [71.0, 720.3, 264.1, 756.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "caption": "", "text": "", "status": "kept", "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/0", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 658.1, 180.2, 682.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "BLA 761044 / S-020 BLA 125261 / S-172", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/1", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 561.5, 309.5, 627.4], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Janssen Biotech, Inc Attention: Michelle Godin, M.S. Associate Director, Global Regulatory Affairs 1125 Trenton-Harbourton Road Titusville, NJ 08560", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/2", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 520.0, 184.2, 530.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "Dear Michelle Godin:", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["Dear Michelle Godin:"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/3", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 451.0, 534.9, 503.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Please refer to your supplemental biologics license applications (sBLA) received June 16, 2025 (BLA 761044 / S-020), and November 7, 2025 (BLA 125261 / S-172), and your amendments, submitted under section 351(a) of the Public Health Service Act for Stelara (ustekinumab) injection.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["Dear Michelle Godin:"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/4", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 409.6, 535.2, 434.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "This Prior Approval sBLA provides for the addition of an indication for the treatment of pediatric patients 2 years and older with moderately to severely active Crohn's disease.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["Dear Michelle Godin:"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/5", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 382.0, 215.4, 392.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "APPROVAL & LABELING", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["APPROVAL & LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/6", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 326.8, 535.6, 365.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We have completed our review of this application, as amended. It is approved, effective on the date of this letter, for use as recommended in the enclosed agreed-upon labeling.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["APPROVAL & LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/7", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 299.2, 214.6, 310.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "CONTENT OF LABELING", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/8", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 202.6, 534.2, 282.4], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "As soon as possible, but no later than 14 days from the date of this letter, submit, via the FDA automated drug registration and listing system (eLIST), the content of labeling [21 CFR 601.14(b)] in structured product labeling (SPL) format, as described at FDA.gov, 1 that is identical to the enclosed labeling (text for the Prescribing Information, Instructions for Use, and Medication Guide) and include the labeling changes proposed in any pending \"Changes Being Effected\" (CBE) supplements.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/9", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 161.2, 502.7, 185.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Information on submitting SPL files using eLIST may be found in the guidance for industry SPL Standard for Content of Labeling Technical Qs and As. 2", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/10", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 133.6, 440.7, 144.4], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "The SPL will be accessible via publicly available labeling repositories.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/11", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 95.4, 456.6, 104.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "footnote", "text": "1 http://www.fda.gov/ForIndustry/DataStandards/StructuredProductLabeling/default.htm", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/12", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 72.4, 534.3, 93.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "footnote", "text": "2 We update guidances periodically. For the most recent version of a guidance, check the FDA Guidance Documents Database https://www.fda.gov/RegulatoryInformation/Guidances/default.htm.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/13", "parent": "#/groups/0", "page": 1, "bbox": [10.0, 8.3, 92.7, 15.7], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Reference ID: 5781349", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/14", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [388.0, 644.3, 540.1, 655.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/15", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 742.7, 180.2, 753.5], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 761044 / S-020", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/16", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 728.9, 180.2, 739.7], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 125261 / S-172", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/17", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 715.1, 110.1, 725.9], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "Page 2", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/18", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 581.6, 538.9, 689.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Also within 14 days, amend all pending supplemental applications that include labeling changes for this BLA, including pending \"Changes Being Effected\" (CBE) supplements, for which FDA has not yet issued an action letter, with the content of labeling [21 CFR 601.12(f)] in Microsoft Word format that includes the changes approved in this supplemental application, as well as annual reportable changes. To facilitate review of your submission(s), provide a highlighted or marked-up copy that shows all changes, as well as a clean Microsoft Word version. The marked-up copy should provide appropriate annotations, including supplement number(s) and annual report date(s).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/19", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 554.0, 297.3, 564.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/20", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 457.5, 535.4, 537.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Under the Pediatric Research Equity Act (PREA) (21 U.S.C. 355c), all applications for new active ingredients (which includes new salts and new fixed combinations), new indications, new dosage forms, new dosing regimens, or new routes of administration are required to contain an assessment of the safety and effectiveness of the product for the claimed indication(s) in pediatric patients unless this requirement is waived, deferred, or inapplicable.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/21", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 416.1, 523.3, 440.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Because this drug product for this indication has an orphan drug designation, you are exempt from this requirement.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/22", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 388.5, 369.3, 399.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "FULFILLMENT OF POSTMARKETING COMMITMENT", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["FULFILLMENT OF POSTMARKETING COMMITMENT"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/23", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 333.3, 535.5, 371.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We have received your submission dated June 16, 2025, containing the final reports for the following postmarketing commitment listed in the September 23, 2016, approval letter for BLA 761044.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["FULFILLMENT OF POSTMARKETING COMMITMENT"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/24", "parent": "#/groups/1", "page": 2, "bbox": [90.0, 264.3, 538.8, 316.5], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "list_item", "text": "3112-3 Conduct a randomized, controlled, blinded, multicenter trial to evaluate the safety and efficacy of STELARA (ustekinumab) in pediatric patients 2 to 17 years of age with moderately to severely active Crohn's disease despite conventional therapy.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["FULFILLMENT OF POSTMARKETING COMMITMENT"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/25", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 222.9, 508.5, 247.5], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We have reviewed your submission and conclude that the above commitment was fulfilled.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["FULFILLMENT OF POSTMARKETING COMMITMENT"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/26", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 195.3, 235.3, 206.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/27", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 112.5, 522.2, 178.4], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "You may request advisory comments on proposed introductory advertising and promotional labeling. For information about submitting promotional materials, see the final guidance for industry Providing Regulatory Submissions in Electronic and NonElectronic Format-Promotional Labeling and Advertising Materials for Human Prescription Drugs. 3", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/28", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 72.4, 434.3, 93.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "footnote", "text": "3 For the most recent version of a guidance, check the FDA guidance web page at https://www.fda.gov/media/128163/download.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/29", "parent": "#/groups/2", "page": 2, "bbox": [10.0, 8.3, 92.7, 15.7], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Reference ID: 5781349", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/30", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 59.4, 238.4, 68.4], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "U.S. Food and Drug Administration", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/31", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 47.9, 180.2, 56.8], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Silver Spring, MD 20993", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/32", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 36.4, 133.6, 45.3], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "www.fda.gov", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/33", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 715.1, 180.2, 753.5], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 761044 / S-020 BLA 125261 / S-172 Page 3", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/34", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 636.8, 532.6, 689.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "You must submit final promotional materials and Prescribing Information, accompanied by a Form FDA 2253, at the time of initial dissemination or publication [21 CFR 601.12(f)(4)]. Form FDA 2253 is available at FDA.gov. 4 Information and Instructions for completing the form can be found at FDA.gov. 5", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/35", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 526.4, 530.8, 620.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "All promotional materials that include representations about your drug product must be promptly revised to be consistent with the labeling changes approved in this supplement, including any new safety-related information [21 CFR 601.12(f)(4)]. The revisions in your promotional materials should include prominent disclosure of the important new safety-related information that appears in the revised labeling. Within 7 days of receipt of this letter, submit your statement of intent to comply with 21 CFR 601.12(f)(4).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/36", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 498.9, 243.4, 509.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "REPORTING REQUIREMENTS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/37", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 457.5, 531.9, 482.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We remind you that you must comply with reporting requirements for an approved BLA (in 21 CFR 600.80 and in 21 CFR 600.81).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/38", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 416.1, 430.9, 440.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "If you have any questions, call me at (301) 796-9007 or email me at jay.fajiculay@fda.hhs.gov.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/39", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [279.1, 388.5, 331.8, 399.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Sincerely,", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/40", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [279.1, 360.9, 502.5, 371.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "{See appended electronic signature page}", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/41", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [279.1, 278.1, 539.8, 344.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Suna Seo, MD, MSc Acting Associate Director for Therapeutic Review Division of Gastroenterology Office of Immunology and Inflammation Center for Drug Evaluation and Research", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/42", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 236.7, 158.1, 247.5], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "ENCLOSURES:", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["ENCLOSURES:"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/43", "parent": "#/groups/3", "page": 3, "bbox": [90.0, 222.1, 212.0, 232.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "list_item", "text": "Content of Labeling", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["ENCLOSURES:"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/44", "parent": "#/groups/3", "page": 3, "bbox": [126.0, 208.2, 267.4, 219.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "list_item", "text": "o Prescribing Information", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["ENCLOSURES:"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/45", "parent": "#/groups/3", "page": 3, "bbox": [126.0, 194.4, 237.4, 205.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "list_item", "text": "o Medication Guide", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["ENCLOSURES:"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/46", "parent": "#/groups/3", "page": 3, "bbo